    },
    {
      "text": "Stir Bisquick mix, milk, 3 tablespoons sugar, and butter in a medium bowl until soft dough forms. Drop dough by 6 spoonfuls onto an ungreased cookie sheet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until golden brown, 10 to 12 minutes. Meanwhile, beat whipping cream in a medium bowl with electric mixer on high speed until soft peaks form.",
